editor_description = "Story beat 4, depth 2,500: Rotini is introduced on the cave path. He is a rat and reads much smaller than the miner, so he comes in quickly and stands close; at the other visitors' spacing he would be a speck at the edge of the frame. His art is drawn looking left, so he stays on the miner's right. The rutini_* resource names refer to Rotini until a coordinated rename is approved."
